<title>
Exhaust Manifold Inspection
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLBA0C1B06002">Exhaust Manifold Removal and Installation</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Using straightedge and feeler gauge, check gasket surface for distortion. If distortion exceeds its limit, repair it.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If repair is not possible, replace exhaust manifold.
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Distortion of exhaust manifold [a] – [e]
</title>
<ptxt>
Limit: 0.3 mm (0.012 in.)
</ptxt>
</spec>
<spec>
<title>
Distortion of exhaust manifold [f] – [i]
</title>
<ptxt>
Limit: 0.7 mm (0.028 in.)
</ptxt>
</spec>
